interpretation that the inquiry was more of a statement and not a question requiring response.  Main
motion as amended carried.  Voting “yes” -- Mr. Johnson, Mr. Luna, Dr. Rinne, Mr. Roybal, Mr.
Shanor and Mr. White.  Voting “no” -- Mr. Brown, Mr. Cook, Ms Williams and Mayor Kaysen.
